# Copy to ~/.config/homepod-sink/homepod-sink.env.
#
# homepod-sink creates a PipeWire virtual sink for every AirPlay 2 device it
# discovers on the network. There's nothing to configure to pick a target -
# select whichever one you want from your system's audio output picker
# (e.g. Noctalia), the same way you'd pick between any other output device.

# HOMEPOD_SAMPLE_RATE=48000
